OL,5,G2100 Kate Bush: The Timeless Genius
OL,6,     FHow has the woman nicknamed the
OL,7,     F'Sound Witch' managed to transcend
OL,8,     Feras and trends, remaining as
OL,9,     Fmodern and fascinating as ever?
OL,10,     FWhat accounts for her timeless
OL,11,     Fgenius? Documentary.
OL,12,G2215 Bjork: Cornucopia
OL,13,     FThe eponymous concert tour, which
OL,14,     Fdebuted as a residency at The Shed
OL,15,     Fin New York City before travelling
OL,16,     Fthe world and concluding four
OL,17,     Fyears later. Flashing images.
